FILE_DESCRIPTION(
/* description */ (
'Neck/collar fit-test article. Isolated section of urn-body neck taper
 + 78mm OD / 8mm-tall then 10mm-thick collar band, internal ID 58mm pr
eserved throughout. Purpose: physically test whether a real crematoriu
m remains bag passes through the 58mm neck opening (spec doc4.4 named 
risk) before committing to a full ~160mm body print. Not a substitute 
for urn-body; does not replace or modify it. Material: same as urn-bod
y (matte/silk PLA) for a representative test, though material is not c
ritical for a fit-check article.'),
/* implementation_level */ '2;1');

